WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.885 --> 00:00:19.331
"The day is finally here!"

2
00:00:20.291 --> 00:00:23.713
Ally looked around the parking lot of the Sandville UFO Museum.

3
00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:27.655
"It's going to be great," Mateo said.

4
00:00:27.675 --> 00:00:30.556
"We've got a proven recipe."

5
00:00:32.168 --> 00:00:33.989
"And fantastic helpers!"

6
00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:35.350
Kate said, grinning.

7
00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:40.013
"I really appreciate everyone helping me with the cooking," Barry said.

8
00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:41.474
"Of course!"

9
00:00:41.935 --> 00:00:42.455
Ally said.

10
00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:45.337
"And Randy is standing by if you need a break.

11
00:00:46.478 --> 00:00:49.640
It was nice of Ray to let us close the diner for the day."

12
00:00:51.701 --> 00:00:52.782
Barry looked nervous.

13
00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:55.664
"What if no one wants the Beta Burgana?

14
00:00:56.185 --> 00:00:57.545
What if it seems boring?"

15
00:00:57.565 --> 00:01:00.988
"Oh, people will want it," Ally said.

16
00:01:02.364 --> 00:01:03.505
"Or so I hope!"

17
00:01:03.825 --> 00:01:04.305
she thought.

18
00:01:05.446 --> 00:01:08.667
Dawn came running over to the truck, carrying a large bag.

19
00:01:08.687 --> 00:01:12.529
"I made you all some special aprons for the contest."

20
00:01:12.549 --> 00:01:17.351
"Awesome!" The kids all put on the aprons.

21
00:01:17.371 --> 00:01:22.314
"You look just like a professional team," Dawn said.

22
00:01:22.334 --> 00:01:24.675
"Go win the contest!"

23
00:01:30.716 --> 00:01:33.118
Soon there was a long line at Rolling Ray's.

24
00:01:39.483 --> 00:01:41.325
line is longer than Pepe's!"

25
00:01:41.685 --> 00:01:42.566
Bethany reported.

26
00:01:42.586 --> 00:01:45.508
"Everything is going really well!"

27
00:01:45.829 --> 00:01:46.569
Mateo said.

28
00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:50.032
Ally nodded, but she kept looking around uneasily.

29
00:01:51.073 --> 00:01:51.994
Who was the spy?

30
00:01:52.554 --> 00:01:54.596
Would somebody try to sabotage them again?

31
00:01:54.616 --> 00:01:59.060
"Without my powers there's not much I can do," she thought.

32
00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:02.903
"But I can still try to find out who's been spying on us.

33
00:02:03.924 --> 00:02:07.247
An Astralian never gives up."

34
00:02:07.867 --> 00:02:09.509
Dawn reached the front of the line.

35
00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:11.851
"I'll take two burgers, please.

36
00:02:12.831 --> 00:02:16.434
Flo and I set up a blanket on the grass to wait for the results of the judging

37
00:02:16.475 --> 00:02:17.035
to come in.

38
00:02:17.535 --> 00:02:18.516
Good luck, kids.

39
00:02:19.037 --> 00:02:21.379
Whatever happens, you're all winners!"

40
00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:30.422
Several hours later the teams gathered around a small stage.

41
00:02:31.403 --> 00:02:33.044
A voice came over the loudspeaker.

42
00:02:33.064 --> 00:02:36.146
"This is the moment we've all been waiting for!

43
00:02:36.446 --> 00:02:40.009
Please welcome the host of our show, Mark Marx!"

44
00:02:41.049 --> 00:02:43.931
People applauded as a man came out from behind the curtain.

45
00:02:43.951 --> 00:02:47.273
"What a fabulous contest!"

46
00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:48.494
Mark Marx said.

47
00:02:48.514 --> 00:02:51.376
"We've had a great time in Sandville.

48
00:02:51.856 --> 00:02:53.097
Such a friendly place.

49
00:02:54.038 --> 00:02:55.539
Except He laughed.

50
00:02:57.428 --> 00:02:59.950
"We wish we'd met at least one alien!"

51
00:03:00.591 --> 00:03:03.493
Everyone laughed—everyone except Ally.

52
00:03:04.614 --> 00:03:10.039
"Now, if you've ever seen our show," Mark Marx continued, "you might think we're just a wholesome cooking

53
00:03:10.079 --> 00:03:14.182
show. But behind the scenes, we like to spice up the competition.

54
00:03:14.883 --> 00:03:17.545
Here are some highlights of our behind-the-scenes activity!"

55
00:03:18.446 --> 00:03:22.469
Ally watched as videos played on the screen on the back wall of the stage.

56
00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:25.252
One food truck's food went bad.

57
00:03:26.116 --> 00:03:28.557
Another team never got their food delivery.

58
00:03:29.698 --> 00:03:31.018
"Huh," Ally thought.

59
00:03:31.038 --> 00:03:34.620
"Rolling Ray's isn't the only truck that had problems."

60
00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:40.462
But then came a video of Jerry cutting the propane and power lines on Rolling Ray's.

61
00:03:41.803 --> 00:03:45.384
"It was you causing all the trouble!"

62
00:03:45.744 --> 00:03:47.025
Ally shouted angrily.

63
00:03:47.045 --> 00:03:50.666
"Jerry! You should be ashamed of yourself!"

64
00:03:51.627 --> 00:03:53.027
"Please calm down!"

65
00:03:53.428 --> 00:03:54.268
Mark Marx said.

66
00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:56.141
"And don't blame our producer.

67
00:03:56.882 --> 00:03:57.943
It's all harmless fun.

68
00:03:58.543 --> 00:04:00.505
We like to throw a few wrenches in the works!"

69
00:04:01.526 --> 00:04:03.607
"So that's how you cut the line!"

70
00:04:03.988 --> 00:04:04.608
Ally cried.

71
00:04:04.628 --> 00:04:06.149
"With a wrench!"

72
00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:09.172
"Sorry about that, Team Rolling Ray's."

73
00:04:10.773 --> 00:04:11.934
Mark Marx laughed.

74
00:04:12.795 --> 00:04:14.816
"But it's an important part of the competition.

75
00:04:15.217 --> 00:04:19.400
You see, our winner is chosen not only for the quality of their food, but also for their

76
00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:23.824
persistence. We were impressed how Rolling Ray's never gave up.

77
00:04:24.452 --> 00:04:28.154
So impressed, in fact You're our winners!"

78
00:04:31.155 --> 00:04:37.477
From behind the curtain, Mark Marx pulled an oversize check for five thousand dollars made out to Rolling

79
00:04:37.577 --> 00:04:39.858
Ray's. "Come and collect your prize!"

80
00:04:40.458 --> 00:04:44.220
Barry, Mateo, Kate, and Bethany all jumped up on the stage.

81
00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:48.722
But Ally stayed where she was, arms folded across her chest.

82
00:04:48.742 --> 00:04:51.783
"I'm happy we won," she thought.

83
00:04:51.803 --> 00:04:53.984
"But I'm mad the show tricked us.

84
00:04:54.452 --> 00:04:56.594
That would never happen on Astralia!"

85
00:04:57.235 --> 00:04:59.396
She watched her friends laughing and grinning.

86
00:05:01.158 --> 00:05:03.420
"I guess I'm not becoming human after all!"

87
00:05:05.081 --> 00:05:09.065
Later, when the Rolling Ray's team was cleaning up, Julius came over to help.

88
00:05:09.085 --> 00:05:11.166
"That was fun."

89
00:05:13.769 --> 00:05:14.549
Bethany yawned.

90
00:05:14.569 --> 00:05:18.993
"And I can't believe we each get a thousand dollars!"

91
00:05:20.074 --> 00:05:22.076
"You deserve it," Dawn said.

92
00:05:22.936 --> 00:05:25.017
"You worked very hard for this win."

93
00:05:25.037 --> 00:05:28.779
"Now I can take some cooking classes," Barry said.

94
00:05:28.799 --> 00:05:32.080
"And I can get my comic," Mateo said.

95
00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:38.283
"Now that the contest is over Julius stepped closer to Ally.

96
00:05:38.303 --> 00:05:40.684
"Can I take you on a real date?"

97
00:05:40.704 --> 00:05:44.106
"Yes!" Ally said.

98
00:05:44.126 --> 00:05:48.008
"But you have to answer my texts," Julius said.

99
00:05:49.436 --> 00:05:52.699
"Maybe you could use your winnings to, um, get a new phone?"

100
00:05:52.719 --> 00:05:56.341
"That's a fantastic idea!"

101
00:05:56.802 --> 00:05:57.422
Ally grinned.

102
00:05:58.403 --> 00:06:00.284
"Julius is right," she thought.

103
00:06:00.304 --> 00:06:06.990
"I need Alpha to work properly—especially so we can figure out how to get my powers back!"
